{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04540","headline":"奉和圣制赐诸州刺史应制以题坐右 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制赐诸州刺史应制以题坐右","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文明遍禹迹，鳏寡达尧心。\n正在亲人守，能令王泽深。\n朝廷多秀士，熔链比精金。\n犀节同分命，熊轩各外临。\n圣主赋新诗，穆若听薰琴。\n先言教爲本，次言则是钦。\n三时农不夺，午夜犬无侵。\n愿使天宇内，品物遂浮沈。\n寄情羣飞鹤，千里一扬音。\n共蹑华胥梦，龚黄安足寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}